   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2. Group chat:\nagents share one conversation; a\nmanager picks who speaks next,\nwhen to stop, when a human joins.\nGood: transparent, refines answers.\nWeak: hard to manage, slower, and\nagents get tied through shared context.",
   "originalText": "2. Group chat:\nagents share one conversation; a\nmanager picks who speaks next,\nwhen to stop, when a human joins.\nGood: transparent, refines answers.\nWeak: hard to manage, slower, and\nagents get tied through shared context.",
