   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "One per team or app; all share the agents.\nTeam 1: LangGraph (Python). Calls remote\nagents, incl. a RAG agent over the\ncorporate knowledge base.\nTeam 2: Semantic Kernel (C#), because\ntheir chatbot already used it.\nMicrosoft Agent Framework (C#): evaluated,\nnot chosen, as it was in preview.\nPicked by familiarity; never benchmarked.",
   "originalText": "One per team or app; all share the agents.\nTeam 1: LangGraph (Python). Calls remote\nagents, incl. a RAG agent over the\ncorporate knowledge base.\nTeam 2: Semantic Kernel (C#), because\ntheir chatbot already used it.\nMicrosoft Agent Framework (C#): evaluated,\nnot chosen, as it was in preview.\nPicked by familiarity; never benchmarked.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
